WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.600
See the work behind the day. Read a recap, then confirm it or add your context.

00:00:01.600 --> 00:00:03.100
Start in My Day. Your recent activity sits below the task queue.

00:00:03.100 --> 00:00:04.600
Read an interval recap. It describes observed work, never a productivity score.

00:00:04.600 --> 00:00:07.000
Confirm or correct it. Choose Looks right, or add the context only you know.

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:09.200
Context, not a verdict. A recap is evidence-bounded activity context.
